# Producer Release OS Rules For Cursor

Thin adapter: read `AGENTS.md` in this repo and the shared contract at
`~/Projects/command-center/tooling/agent-operating-contract.md` rather than inventing
tool-specific behaviour.

Key points:

- Gate before commit: `npm run lint`, `npm run test`, `npm run build`.
- localStorage-only; no backend, auth, or payments in v1.
- Publishing/hosting/deploying is Robin-gated — ask first.
- Work directly on `main`; no PRs or feature branches unless asked.
